@page "/privacy-policy"

<PageTitle>
    Privacy Policy | EMA Nonprofit Technologies
</PageTitle>

<div class="plain-text-page">
    <article class="plain-text-document"
             aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-title">

        <header class="plain-text-document-header">
            <h1 id="privacy-policy-title">
                Privacy Policy
            </h1>

            <p class="plain-text-last-updated">
                <strong>Last Updated:</strong>
                <time datetime="2026-07-14">
                    July 24, 2026
                </time>
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="plain-text-document-content">
            <p class="plain-text-introduction">
                At EMA Nonprofit Technologies
                ("we," "us," or "our"), we are committed
                to protecting the privacy of our users.
                This policy explains how we collect, use,
                and disclose personal information in
                connection with our web-based platform,
                emailmoney.app.
            </p>

            <section aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-commitment">
                <h2 id="privacy-policy-commitment">
                    1. Our Commitment
                </h2>

                <p>
                    We comply with the Personal Information
                    Protection and Electronic Documents Act
                    (PIPEDA) and other applicable Canadian
                    provincial privacy laws.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We are accountable for the personal
                    information under our control and have
                    designated a Privacy Officer to oversee
                    our compliance.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-information">
                <h2 id="privacy-policy-information">
                    2. Information We Collect
                </h2>

                <p>
                    We collect only the information necessary
                    to provide our SaaS donation management
                    services.
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Voluntarily Provided:</strong>
                        Information you provide when creating
                        an account, such as your name, email
                        address, and organization details.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <strong>
                            Donation and e-Transfer Data:
                        </strong>
                        When processing Interac e-Transfer
                        donations, we collect and retain
                        transaction details such as donor
                        name, email address, transfer amount,
                        and reference or message data in order
                        to reconcile donations against your
                        records.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <strong>
                            Payment Card Data through Stripe:
                        </strong>
                        For credit card donations, payment is
                        processed directly by our payment
                        processor, Stripe. We do not receive,
                        transmit, or store credit card numbers
                        or other payment card credentials.
                        This data is handled entirely within
                        Stripe's PCI-compliant systems.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <strong>Automatically Collected:</strong>
                        Technical data such as IP addresses,
                        browser types, and interaction logs
                        with our platform to ensure service
                        performance and security.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-use">
                <h2 id="privacy-policy-use">
                    3. How We Use Your Information
                </h2>

                <p>
                    We use your data strictly for legitimate
                    business purposes, including:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Operating and maintaining the
                        emailmoney.app platform.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Providing customer support and
                        responding to inquiries.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Improving platform functionality
                        through analytics.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Meeting legal, regulatory, or
                        tax-related record-keeping
                        requirements.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-sharing">
                <h2 id="privacy-policy-sharing">
                    4. Data Sharing and Disclosure
                </h2>

                <p>
                    We do not sell your personal information.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We share data with the following
                    categories of third-party service
                    providers only as necessary to perform
                    services on our behalf:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Payment processing:</strong>
                        Stripe, for credit card transactions.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <strong>Hosting infrastructure:</strong>
                        Microsoft Azure Canadian data centres.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    We ensure these partners maintain security
                    standards consistent with our own.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-security">
                <h2 id="privacy-policy-security">
                    5. Data Security and Retention
                </h2>

                <h3>
                    Security
                </h3>

                <p>
                    We protect your information using
                    industry-standard measures, including
                    encryption in transit and at rest and
                    role-based access controls.
                </p>

                <p>
                    All data is hosted on Azure infrastructure
                    located in Canada.
                </p>

                <h3>
                    Retention
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Donation and e-Transfer transaction records
                    are retained for a minimum of six years to
                    meet Canada Revenue Agency financial
                    record-keeping requirements.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Account information, including names,
                    email addresses, and organization details,
                    is retained for the duration of the active
                    account plus a reasonable period
                    thereafter, or as otherwise required by
                    law.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-rights">
                <h2 id="privacy-policy-rights">
                    6. Your Rights
                </h2>

                <p>
                    You have the right to:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Access the personal information we
                        hold about you.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Request corrections to inaccurate
                        information.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Withdraw consent for specific data
                        uses, subject to legal or contractual
                        restrictions.
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        File a complaint with our Privacy
                        Officer or with the Office of the
                        Privacy Commissioner of Canada if you
                        believe your personal information has
                        not been handled in accordance with
                        this policy or applicable law.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="privacy-policy-contact">
                <h2 id="privacy-policy-contact">
                    7. Contact Us
                </h2>

                <p>
                    For questions regarding this policy, to
                    exercise your rights, or to file a
                    complaint, please contact our Privacy
                    Officer:
                </p>

                <address class="plain-text-contact-card">
                    <span>
                        <strong>Name:</strong>
                        Gabriel Pearse
                    </span>

                    <span>
                        <strong>Title:</strong>
                        Founding Solutions Engineer
                    </span>

                    <span>
                        <strong>Email:</strong>

                        <a href="mailto:gabe@pearse.name">
                            gabe@pearse.name
                        </a>
                    </span>
                </address>
            </section>
        </div>

        <footer class="plain-text-document-footer">
            <a href="/">
                Return to EMA Nonprofit Technologies
            </a>
        </footer>
    </article>
</div>